        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2003, Traditional R-Series 24\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's R2003-US3-26 towel bar makes it great for any traditional setting; and the 24 inch length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made out of solid brass with two tone, Polished Brass Bar and Polished Chrome Rosettes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2003-specifications.gif?v=1704354532\" width=\"599\" height=\"164\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2003 24\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Deltana R2003-US3-26 Two Tone Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length center to center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 26-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass Bar / Polished Chrome Rosettes</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2003.pdf?v=1704262290\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2003 24\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (2)  Left.\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware\">Bathroom Fixtures</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
